{"3447090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Digitalink", "steam_appid": 3447090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/4c0f6d189d59a042e2ac6d5ce35afc8c.poster.avif?t=1776902202\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/4c0f6d189d59a042e2ac6d5ce35afc8c.webm?t=1776902202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- We play as Employee 18-32 in a room full of employees at Digitalink. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Digitalink is a company where captures Kaiju (monsters) and does suspicious experiments on them under the name of &quot;public safety&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Newly captured Kaiju is contained in the box behind our computer. Inside, the monster's brain gets exposed certain imagery/icons. Every employee gets &quot;what was the shown imagery/icons&quot; on the left screen as query and the monster's brainwave readings on the right screen (during boot up, you can see the process, BWR stands for Brain Wave Reading systems). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- If you or any other employee in the room makes a mistake, that gives Kaiju to attack our minds, causing to see/hear things that are not real &amp; not there. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - As an employee, you'll be fired after 3 mistakes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You have to highlight a tile that suits what query asks from you and press A to confirm your answer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Example matrix </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A (white) - 3 (green) - 7 (red)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 (purple) - a (yellow) - 9 (white)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 (red) - 0 (blue) - 2 (black)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Example query:</strong> down and right </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right answer:</strong> 2 (black) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Example query:</strong> red and not right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right answer:</strong> 6 (red)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Example query:</strong> lowercase and left and up </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right answer:</strong> doesn't exist in this example matrix (gotta seek in other matrices)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Example query:</strong> up or right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right answers:</strong> A, 3, 7, 9, 2 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Example query:</strong> right and not down </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right answers:</strong> 7 (red), 9 (white)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/9fc9d151a8e9699a1625e56cbe763963.poster.avif?t=1776902202\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/9fc9d151a8e9699a1625e56cbe763963.webm?t=1776902202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/9fc9d151a8e9699a1625e56cbe763963.mp4?t=1776902202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What I Offer in Digitalink:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand the query, find a matching tile in limited time. Mistake? Ups. Run out of time? Ups. Be precise and fast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a teamwork. You are not in danger ONLY when you screw up. If ANY of employees make a mistake, you all will be exposed to mental images.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every session can offer a new game, due to the creature's brain map generated procedurally.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not fighting the monster or running from it —you're studying it. But do you even know what's going on really?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/2673c1fdd82d3a74eed795f8ea4d28dc.poster.avif?t=1776902202\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/2673c1fdd82d3a74eed795f8ea4d28dc.webm?t=1776902202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/2673c1fdd82d3a74eed795f8ea4d28dc.mp4?t=1776902202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/4c0f6d189d59a042e2ac6d5ce35afc8c.poster.avif?t=1776902202\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/4c0f6d189d59a042e2ac6d5ce35afc8c.webm?t=1776902202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- We play as Employee 18-32 in a room full of employees at Digitalink. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Digitalink is a company where captures Kaiju (monsters) and does suspicious experiments on them under the name of &quot;public safety&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Newly captured Kaiju is contained in the box behind our computer. Inside, the monster's brain gets exposed certain imagery/icons. Every employee gets &quot;what was the shown imagery/icons&quot; on the left screen as query and the monster's brainwave readings on the right screen (during boot up, you can see the process, BWR stands for Brain Wave Reading systems). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- If you or any other employee in the room makes a mistake, that gives Kaiju to attack our minds, causing to see/hear things that are not real &amp; not there. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - As an employee, you'll be fired after 3 mistakes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You have to highlight a tile that suits what query asks from you and press A to confirm your answer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Example matrix </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A (white) - 3 (green) - 7 (red)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 (purple) - a (yellow) - 9 (white)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 (red) - 0 (blue) - 2 (black)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Example query:</strong> down and right </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right answer:</strong> 2 (black) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Example query:</strong> red and not right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right answer:</strong> 6 (red)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Example query:</strong> lowercase and left and up </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right answer:</strong> doesn't exist in this example matrix (gotta seek in other matrices)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Example query:</strong> up or right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right answers:</strong> A, 3, 7, 9, 2 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Example query:</strong> right and not down </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right answers:</strong> 7 (red), 9 (white)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/9fc9d151a8e9699a1625e56cbe763963.poster.avif?t=1776902202\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/9fc9d151a8e9699a1625e56cbe763963.webm?t=1776902202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/9fc9d151a8e9699a1625e56cbe763963.mp4?t=1776902202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What I Offer in Digitalink:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand the query, find a matching tile in limited time. Mistake? Ups. Run out of time? Ups. Be precise and fast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a teamwork. You are not in danger ONLY when you screw up. If ANY of employees make a mistake, you all will be exposed to mental images.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every session can offer a new game, due to the creature's brain map generated procedurally.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not fighting the monster or running from it —you're studying it. But do you even know what's going on really?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/2673c1fdd82d3a74eed795f8ea4d28dc.poster.avif?t=1776902202\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/2673c1fdd82d3a74eed795f8ea4d28dc.webm?t=1776902202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/2673c1fdd82d3a74eed795f8ea4d28dc.mp4?t=1776902202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A workplace thriller inspired by Severance (Apple TV) where your job is finding matching values in a pile of matrices to brain map a creature's mind while the creature keeps attacking employ